{"id":"682d2801cf83c784","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Continuous Map","display":"df-zfc-top5-continuous-map — ZFC Top5 Continuous Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-continuous-map — ZFC Top5 Continuous Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-preimage]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-continuous-map — ZFC Top5 Continuous Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"39c10f49239bf771\" href=\"?note=39c10f49239bf771\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-preimage\">58-df-zfc-rel-preimage</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau,\\sigma,f,U,O\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau,\\sigma,f,U,O\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (typed function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (relation-preimage predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall O\\in\\sigma\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(U,f,O)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall O\\in\\sigma\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(U,f,O)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuity is stated by open preimages, with each preimage represented by the canonical relation-preimage predicate.</li>\n<li>The target-open-set variable is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span>; it is distinct from the metatheoretic universe symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-preimage","status":"resolved","id":"39c10f49239bf771","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-preimage]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (typed function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\tau,\\sigma,f,U,O\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall O\\in\\sigma\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\mathrm{ZfcRelPreimage}_S(U,f,O)","display":true},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1328,"backlinks":[{"id":"44867449c3df728b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$（参数顺序为 $(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,f)$，see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md]]）"},{"id":"7f44c09461ec8881","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md]])"},{"id":"32bc331b06024155","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (continuous-map predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md]])"},{"id":"6f2943d50508785c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b914f512d95a604f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S$ (canonical continuous-map predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map]])"},{"id":"7dabbb234eb00a32","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S$（连续映射谓词，见 [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md]]）"},{"id":"82cd211c4765302c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3589","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md|58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","36d7463d215be751","39c10f49239bf771"]}